particular, it leads to the proof of theorem&nbsp;<A HREF="#th.not_gen">2.3</A>, and to
the disproving of Grigoriev's lemma&nbsp;1 of [<A HREF="#Grigoriev.1979"><CITE>14</CITE></A>] (see
§&nbsp;<A HREF="#digraphs">10</A>).<BR>
